This plugin is a community bridge between Meta's Muse Code CLI and Claude Code.
It is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or supported by Meta Platforms, Inc.
or Anthropic, PBC. "Muse" and "Muse Code" are trademarks of their respective
owners.

The marketplace layout, command surface, and job-tracking runtime follow the
structure of OpenAI's codex-plugin-cc (Copyright 2026 OpenAI, Apache-2.0) and
xAI's grok-build-plugin-cc (Copyright 2026 xAI, Apache-2.0). Portions of the
process, git, state, and job-control helpers are adapted from those projects.
The Muse-specific runtime (headless JSONL parsing, session resume, worktree
delegation, transcript transfer) is original to this project.

